WEBVTT

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:22.122
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:26.626
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:30.697
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:35.301
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:43.343
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:54.117
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:58.558
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:02.996
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:07.067
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:14.735
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:39.325
Wake up.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.499
I am someone who understands you.

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:44.637
The reason you are there...

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:46.502
The power locked away within you...

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:48.765
I know it all.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:51.675
And I also know what you desire.

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:54.103
There's no need for you to hesitate.

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:57.547
It's only natural that you
would want to know yourself.

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:59.886
After all, every life born into this world...

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:04.653
...is searching for where it belongs
and what it is meant to do.

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:07.622
Don't worry.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:10.497
It'll be okay. It will be okay.

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:14.160
Now, wake up. Please.

00:02:35.722 --> 00:02:37.349
It's rejecting our every attempt to control it.

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:39.850
We cannot access it.

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:41.853
What is the status of the wormhole driver?

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:45.859
Energy displacement confirmed.
It has begun the firing process.

00:02:46.299 --> 00:02:47.357
We cannot control it.

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.360
This cannot be...

00:02:57.911 --> 00:02:59.003
Good.

00:02:59.779 --> 00:03:03.237
Now, show me your power!

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:24.437
The northern ridge of the Foyt Mountain
Range has been destroyed.

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:26.632
Eighty percent of mass lost.

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:32.208
Why did we not disable it after
the Gravestone incident?

00:03:33.346 --> 00:03:37.680
We have committed an irreparable mistake.

00:03:39.586 --> 00:03:40.883
What have you done?

00:03:41.454 --> 00:03:46.323
Rona Fauna

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.392
Heya.

00:03:55.935 --> 00:03:58.927
You're as quiet on your feet as ever.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.940
Call me cat-footed. Meow.

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:06.279
I had the work done like you asked,

00:04:06.279 --> 00:04:08.381
but if you let this thing loose at full power,

00:04:08.381 --> 00:04:10.440
you'll be pulverized inside.

00:04:11.084 --> 00:04:13.419
Well, as they say, "More includes less."

00:04:13.419 --> 00:04:16.320
There's also the saying,
"Too much is as bad as too little."

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:21.694
Well, be that as it may, being short
on power is still a sad thing.

00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:25.221
If I can get more output, I want
as much as I can get, you know?

00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:27.456
Make sure you don't release the limiter.

00:04:28.001 --> 00:04:29.002
So, what next?

00:04:29.002 --> 00:04:32.028
If you can wait until evening,
I'll deliver it to you.

00:04:32.338 --> 00:04:33.873
What about the Dragon Buster?

00:04:33.873 --> 00:04:38.037
Let me think... I'd say it's about
thirty percent more accurate now.

00:04:38.878 --> 00:04:40.345
Evening's okay by me!

00:04:42.348 --> 00:04:43.337
Oh, Bogie?

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.118
I just got finished.

00:04:45.118 --> 00:04:46.915
She said she'll deliver it in the evening.

00:04:47.387 --> 00:04:49.455
You got a call from the Administration Bureau.

00:04:49.455 --> 00:04:51.355
The Chief Administrator
apparently wants to see you.

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:55.028
Ingrid? I wonder if it's another troublesome job.

00:04:55.028 --> 00:04:57.964
I don't think it'll hurt to just
hear what she has to say.

00:04:57.964 --> 00:05:01.401
That's true. And it could be something good.

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:03.232
Then, I guess I'll drop by there.

00:05:06.773 --> 00:05:07.831
Welcome.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.054
Thank you... very much.

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:32.564
What the heck am I doing?

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:49.209
Oh.

00:05:50.616 --> 00:05:51.584
Oh, my!

00:05:51.584 --> 00:05:53.643
What are you doing, Teacher?

00:05:55.054 --> 00:05:55.888
What am I doing?

00:05:55.888 --> 00:05:56.286
Huh?

00:05:56.756 --> 00:05:58.791
Well, who cares what I was doing.

00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:00.259
Come on, let's go!

00:06:00.259 --> 00:06:02.295
Go? Where?

00:06:02.295 --> 00:06:02.784
Where are you going?

00:06:06.332 --> 00:06:07.526
The Administration Bureau?

00:06:11.003 --> 00:06:12.493
I've been waiting for you.

00:06:13.239 --> 00:06:14.763
Please come right this way.

00:06:16.142 --> 00:06:18.745
Uh, um, where are you going?

00:06:18.745 --> 00:06:21.407
Oh, it doesn't sound like I'm welcome, huh?

00:06:21.514 --> 00:06:23.282
My apologies.

00:06:23.282 --> 00:06:26.479
Today's meeting is for Honoka alone.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.123
Okay, I'll be waiting in the lobby.

00:06:30.123 --> 00:06:30.885
Roger.

00:06:43.503 --> 00:06:45.538
Is this about a job?

00:06:45.538 --> 00:06:48.006
Pardon me. It's not really for me to say.

00:06:50.376 --> 00:06:50.740
Huh?

00:06:51.477 --> 00:06:54.139
The Chief Administrator's office
is on a higher floor, isn't it?

00:06:54.414 --> 00:06:56.644
Today's meeting is taking place
in the conference room.

00:07:04.390 --> 00:07:05.948
I see.

00:07:06.592 --> 00:07:09.493
She had been feeling a vague uneasiness.

00:07:10.396 --> 00:07:14.856
Looking at something invisible to the eye,
Honoka understood what it was.

00:07:15.201 --> 00:07:17.169
Please wait in here.

00:07:22.542 --> 00:07:24.373
Come on out already.

00:07:26.746 --> 00:07:29.916
Honestly! Talk about an elaborate setup.

00:07:29.916 --> 00:07:32.783
What are you up this time, Joganki?!

00:07:33.119 --> 00:07:33.380
Huh?

00:07:36.289 --> 00:07:38.086
Huh? Huh? Huh?

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:39.613
You're cross-dressing?!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:42.155
I am Fila Marique.

00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:45.198
I serve as a Permanent Councilor...

00:07:45.198 --> 00:07:46.722
...on the Central Integrated Government Council.

00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:49.936
Oh, uh, I've heard of you before.

00:07:49.936 --> 00:07:51.597
Um, please excuse me.

00:07:51.804 --> 00:07:53.795
I totally thought you were Joganki.

00:07:54.106 --> 00:07:56.709
You know, because there's
two of them outside the door.

00:07:56.709 --> 00:07:59.846
The only member of The Third that
I thought would want to see me...

00:07:59.846 --> 00:08:00.972
...was Joganki, so...

00:08:01.881 --> 00:08:05.009
It seems he imposes on you frequently.

00:08:05.418 --> 00:08:07.019
Well, every so often.

00:08:07.019 --> 00:08:09.822
Oh, but now that I think about it,
I just realized something.

00:08:09.822 --> 00:08:13.223
I should've figured out sooner
that you weren't Joganki.

00:08:13.893 --> 00:08:14.861
Meaning?

00:08:14.861 --> 00:08:17.463
He wouldn't employ a method like this.

00:08:17.463 --> 00:08:20.099
Going to the trouble of borrowing
a room at the Administrative Bureau...

00:08:20.099 --> 00:08:21.862
...and posting guards all over the place...

00:08:23.236 --> 00:08:24.863
Is... that so?

00:08:25.271 --> 00:08:27.740
He always shows up out of the blue.

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.375
No matter where I am.

00:08:29.375 --> 00:08:33.243
Well, enough about him. You wanted
to see me about something, right?

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:36.412
Yes, the truth is...

00:08:46.726 --> 00:08:47.560
Honoka!

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:48.424
Hold that thought!

00:08:55.501 --> 00:08:57.560
T-This is Honoka...

00:09:05.077 --> 00:09:06.579
Bogie, thanks for waiting.

00:09:06.579 --> 00:09:07.947
What was that gunfire?

00:09:07.947 --> 00:09:09.175
Out-of-control autonomous soldiers.

00:09:09.882 --> 00:09:13.653
Contact the town's home guard.
We'll talk details later.

00:09:13.653 --> 00:09:15.917
You have two guards left. Is that right?

00:09:16.355 --> 00:09:17.287
Yes. In here.

00:09:18.257 --> 00:09:22.023
In here? You mean, there're more?

00:09:24.363 --> 00:09:25.421
Pardon me.

00:09:27.366 --> 00:09:28.492
Bye now!

00:09:29.235 --> 00:09:30.361
My, my.

00:09:30.603 --> 00:09:33.936
Teacher, take care of the guys behind me!

00:09:46.419 --> 00:09:47.784
So cool!

00:09:52.024 --> 00:09:54.794
You'd both have been shot
full of holes if I weren't here.

00:09:54.794 --> 00:09:57.160
But I knew you'd be here.

00:09:58.364 --> 00:10:00.662
At any rate, it looks like we're surrounded.

00:10:06.639 --> 00:10:08.197
What the heck is going on?

00:10:08.341 --> 00:10:10.673
They're this VIP's guards, right?

00:10:12.211 --> 00:10:13.679
It's as you say.

00:10:13.679 --> 00:10:16.614
However, they are no longer under my control.

00:10:17.116 --> 00:10:20.950
The one controlling them should
be somewhere nearby...

00:10:39.338 --> 00:10:40.498
Teacher!

00:10:47.546 --> 00:10:48.648
That's!

00:10:48.648 --> 00:10:49.410
Damn.

00:10:51.917 --> 00:10:53.714
Who the heck was that?

00:11:03.295 --> 00:11:04.455
Damn it!

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:06.288
You okay, Sword Dancer?!

00:11:06.666 --> 00:11:09.658
Hey, Kevin! That was quick!
I knew I could count on you.

00:11:15.841 --> 00:11:18.674
What was that? A military fighter plane?

00:11:20.246 --> 00:11:21.713
This aura...

00:11:22.081 --> 00:11:23.742
Blue Breaker...

00:11:31.157 --> 00:11:33.387
So you are different?

00:11:36.328 --> 00:11:37.659
What have you done?

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:42.394
Nothing at all. I just went to say a quick hello.

00:12:00.286 --> 00:12:02.447
It's really tight quarters here.

00:12:02.555 --> 00:12:06.548
But it'd be better to hide here until
your escort comes for you, right?

00:12:07.927 --> 00:12:08.894
Where is he?

00:12:08.894 --> 00:12:09.485
Huh?

00:12:10.129 --> 00:12:10.493
I...

00:12:10.763 --> 00:12:14.995
O-Oh, he went off again somewhere.

00:12:15.301 --> 00:12:18.327
Oh, really. Isn't that nice?

00:12:19.538 --> 00:12:22.029
I am sorry for troubling you in this way.

00:12:22.541 --> 00:12:24.677
I would like to get right back to
what we were talking about...

00:12:24.677 --> 00:12:26.406
Pass! No more talking!

00:12:27.179 --> 00:12:27.813
What?

00:12:27.813 --> 00:12:30.216
I've got plenty of questions,

00:12:30.216 --> 00:12:34.550
but that kind of trouble back
there is too warlike for me.

00:12:34.854 --> 00:12:37.846
To put it bluntly, it's not my area of expertise.

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:40.718
Well, sure, I'll fight if it's necessary.

00:12:41.127 --> 00:12:43.288
Without anyone ordering me to.

00:12:43.629 --> 00:12:44.497
But...

00:12:44.497 --> 00:12:47.295
You have no intention of
participating in bloodshed.

00:12:47.566 --> 00:12:50.831
Besides, I can't say I like your methods, either.

00:12:52.037 --> 00:12:55.905
You knew that something like
that might happen, right?

00:12:57.042 --> 00:13:00.179
Otherwise, I don't think you'd be
able to discern so easily right then...

00:13:00.179 --> 00:13:03.148
...that there was someone manipulating them.

00:13:03.449 --> 00:13:07.249
In other words, you came here
aware of all the possibilities.

00:13:07.553 --> 00:13:11.580
Knowing that you might be
endangering Emporium.

00:13:11.891 --> 00:13:12.357
Am I wrong?

00:13:13.392 --> 00:13:14.859
I have no response to offer you.

00:13:15.261 --> 00:13:18.287
Well, that's my feeling on it, so I'm sorry.

00:13:18.764 --> 00:13:20.356
Give my regards to Joganki.

00:13:21.467 --> 00:13:24.095
Unfortunately, I cannot.

00:13:25.604 --> 00:13:30.940
Even we do not know what his
current circumstances are.

00:13:31.844 --> 00:13:32.674
What?

00:13:39.018 --> 00:13:41.316
It looks like Fila Marique is taking action.

00:13:42.221 --> 00:13:45.657
It would not be surprising
if she has grown impatient.

00:13:46.158 --> 00:13:48.718
After all, you changed the geography.

00:13:48.961 --> 00:13:51.054
I just scared them a little.

00:13:51.363 --> 00:13:52.193
Isn't that right?

00:13:52.765 --> 00:13:53.697
Yes.

00:13:54.934 --> 00:13:57.236
I'm sure they got the message...

00:13:57.236 --> 00:13:59.772
...that you are serious about
using the wormhole driver.

00:13:59.772 --> 00:14:02.908
But that was nothing more than an ultimatum...

00:14:02.908 --> 00:14:05.308
...that next time, you will destroy this planet.

00:14:05.744 --> 00:14:08.907
I suppose that's what it boils down to.

00:14:16.088 --> 00:14:16.577
How is it?

00:14:17.756 --> 00:14:19.725
The response is beyond compare!

00:14:19.725 --> 00:14:22.091
It ran right up to the limit in one shot!

00:14:22.828 --> 00:14:23.988
It's just awesome!

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:26.999
Do me a favor and break it in
before you play around with it.

00:14:26.999 --> 00:14:30.603
If you wreck it right after it's been tuned,
our funds won't last.

00:14:30.603 --> 00:14:32.571
Yeah, yeah. I'm going to step out for a bit.

00:14:34.306 --> 00:14:37.209
The person you saw earlier...

00:14:37.209 --> 00:14:39.074
The one that was controlling
the autonomous soldiers?

00:14:39.645 --> 00:14:43.515
Yes. It goes without saying that
she is capable of doing so,

00:14:43.515 --> 00:14:46.919
because like ourselves, she is
also a member of The Third.

00:14:46.919 --> 00:14:49.945
How's that related to Joganki?

00:14:50.489 --> 00:14:53.592
She, a woman named Rona Fauna,

00:14:53.592 --> 00:14:55.928
has taken control of a portion
of the Inspection Force...

00:14:55.928 --> 00:14:59.591
...and has entrenched herself
in one of our facilities.

00:15:00.232 --> 00:15:05.260
Joganki acquiesced to her demands
and went alone to negotiate with her,

00:15:05.871 --> 00:15:08.601
but we have lost all contact with him since.

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:15.779
Ooh, the lift is better.
My gliding range is way extended!

00:15:21.487 --> 00:15:26.625
But it's strange that you can't
get in touch with Joganki.

00:15:26.625 --> 00:15:29.492
The Third are all in contact
through their astral eyes, right?

00:15:30.296 --> 00:15:33.933
As you saw, the autonomous soldiers that
were supposed to be my guards...

00:15:33.933 --> 00:15:36.868
...slipped from my control
and went on a rampage.

00:15:37.336 --> 00:15:38.671
It seems Rona Fauna...

00:15:38.671 --> 00:15:43.472
...utilizes a different
communication system than us.

00:15:43.742 --> 00:15:47.041
I see. And that's serving as interference.

00:15:47.313 --> 00:15:50.749
We cannot even confirm if he is alive
or dead, much less communicate.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:54.787
We would send in our forces,
but he might be used as a shield...

00:15:54.787 --> 00:15:57.056
...and we risk the possibility
that our dispatched forces...

00:15:57.056 --> 00:15:59.858
...will also slip beyond our control,

00:15:59.858 --> 00:16:02.258
so we have no means of breaking this deadlock.

00:16:03.562 --> 00:16:05.291
The scope of this thing is huge.

00:16:06.765 --> 00:16:10.135
I am well aware that this is not the sort of thing...

00:16:10.135 --> 00:16:11.500
...I should be coming to you for.

00:16:12.438 --> 00:16:15.771
After all, this is a problem
that is internal to The Third.

00:16:16.275 --> 00:16:17.943
But even so...

00:16:17.943 --> 00:16:22.004
Even though I know that,
I must ask for your help in this matter.

00:16:23.315 --> 00:16:24.612
Honoka,

00:16:25.551 --> 00:16:27.018
if Joganki is alive,

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:30.450
won't you please rescue him for us?

00:16:49.274 --> 00:16:51.677
Locked on! Bogie, I've got you.

00:16:51.677 --> 00:16:55.044
That was 4.28 seconds faster than
yesterday. Not too shabby.

00:16:57.116 --> 00:16:59.983
Whatever the case, it's a huge job.

00:17:00.753 --> 00:17:04.356
If you pull this off successfully,
a nice little fortune will be yours.

00:17:04.356 --> 00:17:06.992
But I can't avoid a shootout
with the Inspection Force...

00:17:06.992 --> 00:17:09.483
...that this Rona Fauna commandeered.

00:17:09.695 --> 00:17:13.399
We're looking at a war.
It's no place for a jack-of-all-trades.

00:17:13.399 --> 00:17:14.491
Why me?

00:17:15.367 --> 00:17:17.269
The answer's simple.

00:17:17.269 --> 00:17:17.963
Huh?

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:20.695
Your client is The Third,
the supreme entity in our world.

00:17:20.939 --> 00:17:23.237
They're not the sort to act on impulses.

00:17:23.942 --> 00:17:26.467
It means they think highly of your abilities.

00:17:26.578 --> 00:17:28.478
Maybe too highly.

00:17:28.647 --> 00:17:31.081
That might be so.

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:32.478
That's no good.

00:17:32.818 --> 00:17:36.481
Well, at least we're certain this
isn't just some coup d'etat fuss.

00:17:38.123 --> 00:17:41.460
I don't really care about
complicated issues like that.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:44.725
Rescue Joganki. That's all that's important.

00:17:46.231 --> 00:17:48.495
"That's all," huh?

00:17:50.035 --> 00:17:52.060
Man, what a pain!

00:17:52.738 --> 00:17:53.363
Bogie.

00:17:53.839 --> 00:17:55.074
Have you decided?

00:17:55.074 --> 00:17:56.735
Make a shopping list.

00:17:57.309 --> 00:18:00.540
Ammunition and whatnot.
Everything you think we might need.

00:18:00.746 --> 00:18:02.577
And make a call to Fila Marique.

00:18:03.182 --> 00:18:06.811
Have her transfer a boatload into
our account as advance payment.

00:18:07.119 --> 00:18:10.555
We're not going to spare any expenses.
So run with it.

00:18:13.425 --> 00:18:16.360
For all the improved output,
the cooling isn't bad.

00:18:16.795 --> 00:18:19.855
I think my operational time
is a bit longer now, too.

00:18:20.299 --> 00:18:22.995
Well, there's no knowing what'll
happen in actual combat, though.

00:18:23.168 --> 00:18:24.036
Honoka.

00:18:24.036 --> 00:18:24.832
Huh?

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:26.271
Are you sure?

00:18:26.271 --> 00:18:27.101
About what?

00:18:27.473 --> 00:18:29.873
We can still turn her down, you know.

00:18:33.112 --> 00:18:35.614
What mischief are you up to this time?

00:18:35.614 --> 00:18:37.416
Huh? What do you mean?

00:18:37.416 --> 00:18:38.713
Don't play dumb.

00:18:38.984 --> 00:18:40.886
The VIP from The Third...

00:18:40.886 --> 00:18:42.988
The shootout with the autonomous soldiers...

00:18:42.988 --> 00:18:46.355
And I hear you've bought up
a ton of ammo to boot.

00:18:47.192 --> 00:18:48.625
Say, Kevin.

00:18:52.231 --> 00:18:55.223
Tell me, why'd you become a mercenary?

00:18:55.734 --> 00:18:58.032
If you don't feel like doing it, don't.

00:19:00.572 --> 00:19:01.596
Does it look that way?

00:19:02.174 --> 00:19:03.539
Beats me.

00:19:04.576 --> 00:19:09.104
Thanks. But I'm still technically a professional.

00:19:09.548 --> 00:19:13.352
I see. Then here's a farewell gift
from a fellow professional.

00:19:13.352 --> 00:19:16.788
Kill them before they kill you, Sword Dancer.

00:19:17.689 --> 00:19:18.678
What will you do?

00:19:20.092 --> 00:19:21.650
I think we just gotta go.

00:19:21.727 --> 00:19:27.393
I can't have the ghost of that Joganki
idiot haunting my sleep someday.

00:19:32.004 --> 00:19:33.665
You take off and you're easy pickings.

00:19:34.206 --> 00:19:37.403
Nevermind that. You seriously
took aim at me, didn't you?!

00:19:44.483 --> 00:19:45.415
Impressive.

00:19:46.151 --> 00:19:47.914
Good job noticing that.

00:19:49.655 --> 00:19:51.714
I'm glad I caught you.

00:19:52.224 --> 00:19:54.488
What is this all about?

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:56.061
I'm coming with you.

00:19:56.061 --> 00:19:56.720
What?

00:19:56.929 --> 00:19:58.794
I'm coming. With. You.

00:19:59.131 --> 00:20:01.733
Oh, no, I heard what you said, but...

00:20:01.733 --> 00:20:05.169
Well, don't let it bother you.
It's like a hobby of mine.

00:20:05.604 --> 00:20:09.597
Besides, it's a great opportunity
to travel alone with you.

00:20:09.808 --> 00:20:12.299
There's no way I can knowingly
let this chance slip by, right?

00:20:12.811 --> 00:20:14.244
Teacher...

00:20:15.147 --> 00:20:16.409
Joganki.

00:20:16.915 --> 00:20:20.976
The moment Honoka had heard that name,
she had her answer.

00:20:22.187 --> 00:20:23.689
She had reservations.

00:20:23.689 --> 00:20:25.452
And she could not get rid
of her sense of unease.

00:20:25.591 --> 00:20:28.894
But the appearance of this
reassuring reinforcement...

00:20:28.894 --> 00:20:31.692
...served to lighten Honoka's mood just a little.

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:33.654
Just a little.

00:20:44.776 --> 00:20:46.073
Have you finished the analysis?

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:51.374
The artificial brain we recovered
showed no signs of damage.

00:20:51.883 --> 00:20:55.080
As expected, it was definitely
not electronic interference.

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.954
I will move on and scan the nervous system.

00:20:58.123 --> 00:20:59.181
Please do that.

00:20:59.992 --> 00:21:03.362
If we can shed light on Rona Fauna's
communication system,

00:21:03.362 --> 00:21:06.798
it will also open the way for us to
take back the wormhole driver system.

00:21:07.366 --> 00:21:08.628
Understood.

00:21:12.638 --> 00:21:13.866
Joganki.

00:21:14.673 --> 00:21:16.800
If you were here, what would you...

00:21:22.014 --> 00:21:23.447
What a weak-spirited thing to think!

00:21:27.019 --> 00:21:27.986
Hey...

00:21:28.954 --> 00:21:30.012
What?

00:21:30.489 --> 00:21:34.823
I'm so glad. I thought you'd
fallen asleep and left me.

00:21:36.061 --> 00:21:37.153
Outside...

00:21:38.163 --> 00:21:39.562
...is it night?

00:21:40.599 --> 00:21:44.831
It is, Joganki.

00:21:53.145 --> 00:21:56.581
An intersection waiting for morning...
Asa o matteiru kousaten ga

00:21:56.581 --> 00:22:00.652
...cradling an abandoned cat that wandered in.
Mayoikonda sute-neko o daiteiru

00:22:00.652 --> 00:22:03.188
Red and green and yellow.
Aka to ao to kiiro

00:22:03.188 --> 00:22:06.214
It is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:06.858 --> 00:22:10.329
Stopping just after dawn,
Akegata-sugi ni furiyanda

00:22:10.329 --> 00:22:14.333
a misty rain made a screen of water.
Kosame ga tsukutta mizu no sukuriin ga

00:22:14.333 --> 00:22:16.902
Until that time when it dries,
Kawaku sono toki made

00:22:16.902 --> 00:22:20.065
it is simply gentle.
Sore wa tada yasashii

00:22:20.138 --> 00:22:23.608
More than small coincidences like that,
Sonna chiisana guuzen yori mo

00:22:23.608 --> 00:22:27.012
the fact that you are there...
Kimi ga soko ni iru koto ga

00:22:27.012 --> 00:22:30.482
...cannot be a small thing, I think.
Chiisai hazu ga nai to omounda

00:22:30.482 --> 00:22:34.111
Even though it's obvious.
Atarimae nandakedo

00:22:35.787 --> 00:22:42.561
It must be sad not to have anyone.
Daremo inai to kanashii koto deshou

00:22:42.561 --> 00:22:49.262
Now, come on out to where the sun is shining.
Saa hi no ataru basho e dete-oide

00:22:49.501 --> 00:22:56.341
Even the several incidents that trouble you...
Kimi o komaraseru ikutsuka no dekigoto mo

00:22:56.341 --> 00:23:01.176
...are coincidences of yesterdays past.
Kinou izen no guuzen nanda yo

00:23:03.148 --> 00:23:08.745
Though, I'm sure you actually know that already.
Hontou wa wakatteru to omou kedo

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:16.889
Preview

00:23:17.262 --> 00:23:19.822
We launch the plan to rescue Joganki.

00:23:20.165 --> 00:23:25.501
A reckless plan involving us storming
Rona Fauna's facility alone.

00:23:25.971 --> 00:23:28.774
But it isn't the details of this plan,

00:23:28.774 --> 00:23:31.265
but something else that disturbs me more.

00:23:31.743 --> 00:23:36.976
The appearance of Blue Breaker
as a member of our party.

00:23:37.649 --> 00:23:41.052
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:41.052 --> 00:23:42.120
episode 18, "Engage".

00:23:42.120 --> 00:23:43.288
Engage
episode 18, "Engage".

00:23:43.288 --> 00:23:44.915
Engage
